.vscode

installers

# Docker build files (internal use only)
linux-build

# Knowledge graph output (graphify)
graphify-out

# Built control panel. Generated from the idleview-control submodule by tauri's
# beforeDev/beforeBuild command, so it is no longer committed - every vite build
# emits freshly hash-named assets, and committing them orphaned the previous set
# into history on each build while leaving two copies of the panel to ship the
# wrong one from.
#
# The leading slash matters: "idleview-control" unanchored would also match the
# submodule at the repo root, which IS tracked (as a gitlink).
/src-tauri/idleview-control/